# 5.5.4, the ImageSpace remainder, under the flush latch: latch-census.env's switches on a short tour of Whiterun (the fog SAO
# composite), Dragonsreach (the full SAO composite) and Riverwood's river (the water's flow copies, refraction). The census
# windows should show no ImageSpace draw or dispatch reaching D3D11 but the volumetric lighting's (VL agent): no
# ISSAOComposite*, ISCopySubRegionCS or ISRefraction class, and the latch's allowed draws no longer list "imagespace: shape
# refused", "shape not in the manifest" or "failed on the graph". Log: "[ORG] ImageSpace: made the water's flow map", the
# flow copy and composite passes in "registered <n> passes", no "<pass>: ... is not on the graph" line, no "[ORG] ImageSpace:"
# error. Run twice from a fresh variant: the first run fills the shape manifest. The flow copies only happen when Unified
# Water did not patch them out (its mesh missing); otherwise expect none. Keep the switch lines in step with latch-census.env.
# cs-ab: disable-mod=Skyrim Engine Telemetry
CS_ORG_IMAGESPACE_LOG=1
CS_ORG_ENGINE_FLUSH_LATCH=1
CS_ORG_RESIDUE_CENSUS=1
CS_ORG_RESIDUE_CENSUS_FRAMES=300
CS_ORG_RESIDUE_CENSUS_TOP=60
CS_ORG_SHADOW_MASK=1
CS_ORG_COMPOSITE=1
CS_ORG_IBL=1
CS_ORG_SCREEN_SPACE_SHADOWS=1
CS_ORG_TERRAIN_SHADOWS=1
CS_ORG_VOLUMETRIC_SHADOWS=1
CS_ORG_SKYLIGHTING=1
CS_ORG_GRASS_COLLISION=1
CS_ORG_LIGHT_LIMIT_FIX_SHADOWS=1
CS_ORG_SCREEN_SPACE_GI=1
CS_ORG_SUBSURFACE_SCATTERING=1
CS_ORG_EXPONENTIAL_HEIGHT_FOG=1
CS_ORG_DYNAMIC_CUBEMAPS=1
CS_ORG_CLOUD_SHADOWS=1
CS_ORG_POST_PROCESSING=1
CS_ORG_HDR_DISPLAY=1
CS_ORG_UPSCALING=1
CS_ORG_SCREENSHOT=1
CS_ORG_TERRAIN_BLENDING=1
CS_ORG_GLINTS=1
CS_ORG_E11_RAYS=1
CS_ORG_IMGUI=1
CS_ORG_TRIPWIRE_GUEST=1
CS_ORG_ENGINE_TARGETS=1
CS_ORG_ENGINE_TARGET_HANDLES=1
CS_ORG_ENGINE_BUFFERS=1
CS_ORG_ENGINE_TEXTURES=1
CS_ORG_ENGINE_SHADERS=1
CS_ORG_TEXTURE_STREAMING=1
CS_ORG_ENGINE_CONSTANTS=1
CS_ORG_ENGINE_SKELETON=1
CS_ORG_SKY=1
CS_ORG_SKY_CLOUDS=0
CS_ORG_WATER=1
CS_ORG_BLOOD_SPLATTER=1
CS_ORG_IMAGESPACE=1
CS_ORG_MENU3D=1
CS_ORG_MAP=1
CS_ORG_SCALEFORM=1
CS_ORG_BINK=1
CS_ORG_LOADING_THREAD=1
CS_ORG_TRIPWIRE_WATCH_ALL=1
DXVK_DEBUG=hang
VK_LOADER_LAYERS_DISABLE=*nsight*
CS_DCLF_TEST_COMMANDS=600:set timescale to 0;601:set gamehour to 13;602:fw 81a;700:coc Whiterun;1500:dclf:shot=whiterun;1600:coc WhiterunDragonsreach;2400:dclf:shot=dragonsreach;2500:coc Riverwood;3400:set timescale to 0;3410:fw 81a;3500:player.setpos x 19300;3501:player.setpos y -45300;3502:player.setpos z -80;3510:player.setangle x 12;3511:player.setangle z 0;3900:dclf:shot=river;3910:tfc;4200:dclf:shot=river-tfc
CS_DCLF_TEST_EXIT=4300
